OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn of risks when posting
OL,4,Aschool photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Police has warned parents
OL,7,Fabout posting back-to-school photos
OL,8,Fcontaining identifying information on
OL,9,Fsocial media.
OL,11,FThis followed a social media post by
OL,12,FSussex Police which highlighted how the
OL,13,Fphotos could allow individuals to
OL,14,Fcreate Artificial-Intelligence (AI)
OL,15,Fgenerated child abuse imagery or
OL,16,Fidentify a family's location and
OL,17,Fschedule.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
