OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn of risks when posting
OL,4,Aschool photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FNot-for-profit organisations and
OL,7,Fsupervisory data bodies have encouraged
OL,8,Fparents to be aware when posting such
OL,9,Fphotos when schools return for the next
OL,10,Fterm.
OL,12,FDI Tom Lowe, from Guernsey Police,
OL,13,Fsaid: "We're not trying to discourage
OL,14,Fpeople recording these memories [but
OL,15,Fwish to] highlight the risk."
